{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LangChain核心架构与五大模块\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"LangChain核心架构与五大模块\" dir=\"auto\">LangChain核心架构与五大模块</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明LangChain的核心架构，包括其主要模块和各个模块的作用。LangChain 1.x版本相比早期版本有哪些架构演进？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>LangChain 1.x 核心架构（五大模块）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LangChain在1.x版本中完成了从\"组件库\"到\"Agent操作系统\"的蜕变，核心架构演进为包含LangGraph在内的五大模块：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>LangChain Libraries（代码库本体）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">langchain-core</code>：最底层抽象，定义模型接口、工具接口、向量存储等基础协议，代码量少但扩展性强</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">langchain</code>：主库，包含Chain和Agent的编排逻辑</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">langchain-community</code>：社区贡献的第三方集成</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>核心组件层</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Models（模型）</strong>：统一接口封装LLM（如GPT-4、Claude）和ChatModel</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Chains（链）</strong>：将多个组件组合成可复用流程，支持LCEL（LangChain Expression Language）声明式编排</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Agents（智能体）</strong>：封装ReAct、Plan-and-Execute等规划策略，动态决策工具调用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Memory（记忆）</strong>：提供短期记忆（对话历史）、长期记忆（向量数据库）等多种记忆类型</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Tools（工具）</strong>：外部功能封装，如搜索、计算、API调用</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>LangGraph（状态图编排）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">基于有向图的工作流编排引擎</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">支持条件分支、循环、并行执行、人工干预</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>集成层</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">数百种LLM、向量存储、文档加载器的统一集成</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>部署与监控</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">LangSmith：可观测性平台，用于追踪、评估和监控</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：核心组件使用</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_openai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ChatOpenAI\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>prompts <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ChatPromptTemplate\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>output_parsers <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> StrOutputParser\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> tool\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 1. Model - 模型封装</span>\nllm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ChatOpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> temperature<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. Prompt - 提示模板</span>\nprompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ChatPromptTemplate<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"system\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"你是一个专业的{role}\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"human\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"{question}\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. Tool - 工具定义</span>\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@tool</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">search</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"搜索互联网获取信息\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 实际调用搜索API</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"搜索结果: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 4. Chain - LCEL链式编排</span>\nchain <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> prompt <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> llm <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> StrOutputParser<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 5. 执行</span>\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> chain<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"AI研究员\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"question\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"什么是RAG?\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">langchain-core</code>的设计理念是什么？为什么要将核心抽象独立出来？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：解耦依赖，让下游包只依赖核心抽象而不依赖具体实现，避免循环依赖，提高扩展性。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：LCEL相比传统Chain方式的优势是什么？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：LCEL采用管道操作符<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">|</code>实现声明式编排，支持流式输出、异步执行、并行调用，且与Runnable协议统一，所有组件都实现了<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">invoke</code>/<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">ainvoke</code>/<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">stream</code>等标准接口。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：认为LangChain只是一个\"胶水代码\"框架，没有技术含量。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：LangChain提供了完整的LLM应用抽象层和协议，其价值在于标准化接口和生态集成，但在简单场景下确实可能引入过度抽象。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}